      "content": "Thanks, that's a decent start. It's pretty high level though. Can you expand a bit more on the 'pros'? Specifically, I want to understand the positive impact this might have on global trade standards and how it bolsters the green energy sector. \n\nAgain, just a reminder: the sentiment score is just a metric for the dashboard, so don't feel like you have to make it sound overly optimistic. I just need more detail on the benefits for the briefing.",
